==========


DwarfStar is a specialized, self-contained inference engine built on the foundations of llama.cpp and GGML, designed to run specific open-weight models like DeepSeek V4 and GLM 5.x efficiently on consumer hardware using Metal, CUDA, or ROCm backends. It features first-class support for SSD streaming
